WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS.

01:43.425 --> 01:44.545
Put it down.

01:44.625 --> 01:46.105
Slow down.

01:47.945 --> 01:49.305
Why are you sneaking around like that?

01:50.305 --> 01:51.145
Take a look.

01:51.945 --> 01:52.785
CINDY

01:52.865 --> 01:55.945
One of my inside contacts
at Bolo Culture just tipped me off.

01:56.025 --> 01:59.425
She said she saw Lin Long getting
into Mr. Shen's car after work last night,

01:59.505 --> 02:00.905
and they were all over each other.

02:00.985 --> 02:02.865
Those two have been acting weird lately.

02:02.945 --> 02:04.745
Ask her what's going on.

02:04.825 --> 02:06.785
Final delivery is coming up.

02:06.865 --> 02:10.345
I don't want any drama
like with the Celestial project.

02:10.864 --> 02:11.905
Is that true?

02:12.905 --> 02:14.625
I just didn't drive that day.

02:14.705 --> 02:16.185
Mr. Shen gave me a ride.

02:16.265 --> 02:17.225
Is it really that big a deal?

02:18.105 --> 02:19.025
Cindy loves to make stuff up about me.

02:19.105 --> 02:20.065
It's not the first time.

02:21.505 --> 02:22.505
Seriously,

02:22.585 --> 02:23.905
I'm telling you, I've known you for years.

02:23.985 --> 02:26.545
You can't fool me.
Your face just now gave it away.

02:27.705 --> 02:28.825
Did it?

02:28.905 --> 02:29.945
Wait, no way.

02:30.025 --> 02:35.505
How could you make such a rookie mistake
and get tangled up with a client?

02:36.025 --> 02:37.785
Don't tell me your divorce
messed you up so bad

02:37.865 --> 02:39.425
your head's not on straight?

02:40.025 --> 02:42.105
Listen, you need to pump the brakes.

02:42.625 --> 02:44.065
Don't worry. No brakes needed.

02:44.145 --> 02:45.465
Because nothing ever started.

02:45.545 --> 02:46.585
Really?

02:47.865 --> 02:48.945
That's good.

02:49.025 --> 02:51.945
I thought you weren't thinking straight
and would fall for it.

02:52.025 --> 02:55.105
With your situation right now,
how could Shen ever genuinely like you?

02:55.185 --> 02:57.265
He's definitely just got a whim
and wants a taste of…

02:57.985 --> 02:59.985
A taste of something new. I get it.

03:00.705 --> 03:01.865
Excuse me.

03:02.785 --> 03:05.985
Why would a unicorn startup founder
fall for someone like me,

03:06.065 --> 03:07.385
a divorced woman?

03:07.905 --> 03:11.985
So when I noticed
he might be even slightly into me,

03:12.065 --> 03:14.265
I shut it down immediately.

03:14.785 --> 03:17.665
I just asked him straight up. I asked him,

03:17.745 --> 03:18.945
"Do you have feelings for me?"

03:19.465 --> 03:21.865
And sure enough,
he chickened out and backed off.

03:22.585 --> 03:24.865
Then why did you get
in his car last night?

03:26.425 --> 03:27.305
Because…

03:28.385 --> 03:30.465
Because I'm a normal human being.

03:30.545 --> 03:31.905
I think after clearing things up,

03:31.985 --> 03:35.225
I have every right
to accept normal kindness from a guy.

03:36.345 --> 03:37.945
And what era are we living in anyway?

03:38.465 --> 03:41.665
I can't just feel inferior
to everyone else because I'm divorced.

03:41.745 --> 03:43.705
That's not what I meant.

03:43.785 --> 03:45.585
I know.

03:48.145 --> 03:49.185
But I have to say,

03:49.745 --> 03:52.545
when a guy who's got it all together

03:52.625 --> 03:55.225
wants to get close to you
and care for you,

03:55.305 --> 03:56.305
it's actually kind of nice.

03:57.825 --> 03:59.385
So that night,

03:59.465 --> 04:01.665
when he insisted on taking me
to get some trendy ice cream,

04:02.265 --> 04:03.265
I said yes.

04:04.065 --> 04:05.545
But in the car, I was torn.

04:06.345 --> 04:08.745
Part of me hated myself
for having no principles,

04:08.825 --> 04:10.865
but the rest of me was glad

04:10.945 --> 04:13.745
I still had it going on enough
to make a man fall for me.

04:15.465 --> 04:19.025
I'm just so indecisive, hesitant…

04:19.105 --> 04:20.025
And a total hypocrite.

04:21.105 --> 04:23.305
But even now,
I don't think I did anything wrong.

04:24.945 --> 04:25.865
Hey you.

04:26.385 --> 04:27.625
You didn't let him

04:28.865 --> 04:30.265
into your place last night, did you?

04:36.065 --> 04:36.945
Come in.

05:00.585 --> 05:01.465
Can I not answer that?

05:04.305 --> 05:05.145
Of course.

05:07.265 --> 05:12.945
MEETING ROOM

05:22.825 --> 05:24.025
Let's talk when we get back.

05:30.385 --> 05:32.345
Is it about Mr. Zheng?

05:34.465 --> 05:36.745
Peng Yuan was fired and handed over
to economic crime investigators.

05:37.265 --> 05:38.745
Ma Ke is off the hook.

05:38.825 --> 05:40.345
His voluntary resignation is accepted.

05:40.865 --> 05:42.785
Yang Rui will stay on with a new team.

05:44.025 --> 05:46.345
The project will fully resume next week.

05:47.745 --> 05:48.705
We keep moving forward.

06:03.385 --> 06:05.705
I did my part today.

06:06.585 --> 06:08.465
Then keep it up

06:08.545 --> 06:10.745
and go buy some milk tea
for everyone to celebrate.

06:10.825 --> 06:11.785
Mango?

06:11.865 --> 06:12.905
Medium matcha.

06:12.985 --> 06:14.425
Light ice, light sugar, no foam topping.

06:15.185 --> 06:16.665
Then I want choco…

06:19.865 --> 06:21.705
Never mind. I'm good.

06:35.345 --> 06:36.425
I've known Richard for so long.

06:37.105 --> 06:40.345
Looks like he's finally met the one.

07:00.825 --> 07:01.825
HUANGHE BUSINESS SCHOOL EMBA
STRATEGIC MANAGEMENT

07:01.905 --> 07:02.905
RISKS, OPPORTUNITIES, AND STRATEGIC
RESPONSES IN DIGITAL COLLECTIBLES MARKET

07:02.985 --> 07:04.105
SPEAKER: YE XINZHI, GUEST PROFESSOR

07:04.185 --> 07:05.025
The digital finance market

07:05.105 --> 07:07.345
is like a blue ocean
full of hope and challenges.

07:07.865 --> 07:10.185
But opportunity and risk go hand in hand.

07:10.265 --> 07:11.505
The domestic crypto market

07:11.585 --> 07:12.785
has been through multiple rounds
of strict regulation

07:12.865 --> 07:14.225
and is relatively stable now.

07:14.305 --> 07:18.305
But the blockchain finance tied to it
is running wild in new forms.

07:18.905 --> 07:20.785
Mr. Ye, what do you think
of digital collectibles?

07:20.865 --> 07:22.545
They're blowing up lately.

07:26.185 --> 07:28.025
That's a great question.

07:28.545 --> 07:31.385
Digital collectibles have
massively expanded the art market.

07:31.465 --> 07:32.545
Compared to traditional collectibles,

07:32.625 --> 07:34.425
they have better liquidity
and transparency,

07:35.025 --> 07:38.625
which draws a ton
of eager investor attention.

07:38.705 --> 07:40.465
I bought a few digital collectibles
to get in on the hype,

07:40.545 --> 07:43.465
but I've noticed
a lot of people into digital collectibles

07:43.545 --> 07:45.585
can't really explain
the business logic behind them.

07:45.665 --> 07:49.185
Most just see them
as an alternative to crypto,

07:49.785 --> 07:51.105
hoping to get rich overnight.

07:51.185 --> 07:54.265
Especially with housing prices dropping
and the stock market weak lately,

07:54.345 --> 07:56.505
lots of regular people
jumped on the bandwagon.

07:56.585 --> 07:57.465
But the overhyping

07:57.545 --> 08:00.465
has pushed the risk
to a pretty alarming level.

08:02.145 --> 08:05.385
Everyone, you're the ones
shaping the market policy.

08:05.985 --> 08:09.065
And steady industry growth
needs everyone's input.

08:09.145 --> 08:11.985
Since we're on the topic
of digital collectibles today,

08:12.065 --> 08:13.345
I'll just assign a paper.

08:14.505 --> 08:16.065
Research on the Operational Models
and Risk Prevention

08:16.145 --> 08:17.385
of Domestic Digital Collectibles.

08:17.985 --> 08:19.465
Work in groups.

08:19.545 --> 08:21.065
We'll discuss it in the next class.

08:21.145 --> 08:22.945
That's it for today. Class is over.

08:33.545 --> 08:36.664
-Mr. Ye, can we add each other on WeChat?
-Sure.

08:38.105 --> 08:39.024
Let me scan yours.

08:39.105 --> 08:42.065
What you talked about today
was so helpful to us.

08:42.144 --> 08:43.985
Hope we can hear
more from you in the future.

08:44.065 --> 08:45.545
-Thank you.
-Thanks so much.

08:50.665 --> 08:52.185
Hello there, Mr. Ye.

08:53.145 --> 08:53.985
Nice try.

08:54.065 --> 08:56.425
Miss Xu, you weren't
paying attention in class,

08:56.505 --> 08:58.065
sipping milk tea
and goofing off down there.

08:58.145 --> 08:59.825
I'm going to have to give you
a serious lecture.

09:01.745 --> 09:03.705
Guess I'll have to bribe you then,

09:04.225 --> 09:05.385
so you won't fail me on the final.

09:06.825 --> 09:08.145
That's more like it.

09:17.945 --> 09:19.945
What you just said was spot on.

09:20.465 --> 09:22.185
You assigned the paper so naturally.

09:23.065 --> 09:24.625
Yuanzhou is such a hot topic right now.

09:24.705 --> 09:25.825
Everyone will definitely use it

09:25.905 --> 09:27.665
as a case study
and dig deep into its problems.

09:29.465 --> 09:32.065
But is that really efficient?

09:33.545 --> 09:36.945
The person I just added on WeChat
is from the Internet Finance Association.

09:37.625 --> 09:38.665
What do you think?

09:44.585 --> 09:46.065
SHEN JIN, BOLO CULTURE

09:54.385 --> 09:56.825
-What are you doing?
-I called you 124 times.

09:56.905 --> 09:58.865
-Why didn't you pick up?
-Didn't hear it.

09:59.585 --> 10:00.865
Then why did you block me on WeChat?

10:00.945 --> 10:02.825
I added you on WeCom, sir.

10:02.905 --> 10:06.505
It's easier for colleagues
to reach you there going forward.

10:07.185 --> 10:08.425
-What did you just call me?
-Sir.

10:09.145 --> 10:11.105
So we're being all formal now?

10:11.865 --> 10:13.785
Mr. Shen, we're just business partners.

10:15.785 --> 10:18.825
Lin Long, you're kicking me
to the curb now?

10:18.905 --> 10:19.825
Use me and toss me aside?

10:19.905 --> 10:21.145
You're playing me for a fool?

10:21.225 --> 10:22.345
No, Mr. Shen--

10:22.425 --> 10:25.105
Who was it that night,
all sweet and tender, asking…

10:25.185 --> 10:27.345
asking if her old ticket
could still get her--

10:27.425 --> 10:28.865
Okay, stop. Nothing happened that night…

10:28.945 --> 10:30.065
-No, hold on…
-Nothing happened that night…

10:30.145 --> 10:31.185
-Let's get this straight.
-I completely forgot.

10:31.265 --> 10:32.105
Lin!

10:34.745 --> 10:36.065
Are you two okay?

10:36.665 --> 10:37.505
We're fine.

10:37.585 --> 10:40.465
Mr. Shen, let's just talk on WeCom
if we need anything.

10:40.545 --> 10:41.585
I'm leaving. Bye.

10:41.665 --> 10:42.745
-Bye.
-Bye.

12:05.865 --> 12:08.465
-I'm really sorry. I…
-You're bleeding.

12:08.545 --> 12:10.785
You're pregnant.
How could you drive so carelessly?

12:11.425 --> 12:12.425
Is the baby okay?

12:13.105 --> 12:15.585
Look at you. You're thin as a rail.

12:16.185 --> 12:19.145
If you haven't fully recovered,
don't rush back to work.

12:19.225 --> 12:20.105
Why push yourself?

12:20.825 --> 12:22.185
Xu Chi brought this to me before.

12:22.265 --> 12:23.865
She said you specifically asked for it,

12:23.945 --> 12:24.745
and she passed along that message.

12:25.785 --> 12:27.745
"A rebirth through hardship
and better days ahead."

12:27.825 --> 12:29.545
I've had my share of hardship.

12:29.625 --> 12:32.345
Now it's time to earn those better days
with my own two hands.

12:33.985 --> 12:35.105
Want to watch this one?

12:36.905 --> 12:38.185
Looks boring.

12:38.265 --> 12:39.225
They say it's good.

12:40.265 --> 12:41.105
Let's go.

12:41.625 --> 12:43.825
I'm serious. Want to give it a shot?

13:15.985 --> 13:17.025
Long.

13:19.745 --> 13:21.385
How have you been?

13:29.345 --> 13:30.465
You're back at work?

13:30.985 --> 13:31.825
Why didn't you take more time off?

13:32.945 --> 13:33.785
None of your business.

13:34.705 --> 13:36.185
Long, listen to me.

13:36.265 --> 13:37.705
-I've actually always wanted to tell you…
-Let go of me.

13:37.785 --> 13:38.745
-I don't want to hear it.
-Zhiwen.

13:40.505 --> 13:41.425
Who is she?

13:43.585 --> 13:46.025
Just a friend. Just ran into each other.

13:46.105 --> 13:47.425
Are you playing me for a fool?

13:47.505 --> 13:49.145
Isn't she your ex-wife?

13:49.225 --> 13:50.065
What's the deal with you two?

13:50.145 --> 13:52.585
You're divorced and still flirting?

13:53.665 --> 13:55.545
He's right. He's playing you for a fool.

13:56.625 --> 13:57.825
Who are you calling a fool?

13:57.905 --> 13:59.505
You're the shameless one
throwing yourself at my boyfriend!

13:59.585 --> 14:01.505
-Don't you know he has a girlfriend now?
-Lin Long!

14:01.585 --> 14:02.425
I knew you'd be here.

14:03.585 --> 14:05.305
-Give it here.
-Are these two your friends?

14:05.385 --> 14:06.505
Give it here.

14:06.585 --> 14:07.385
Car keys.

14:12.465 --> 14:13.745
I didn't want to say this

14:13.825 --> 14:17.585
because I think two women fighting
over a guy is just pathetic.

14:18.385 --> 14:20.545
But to settle this once and for all,
I'll just tell you straight.

14:20.625 --> 14:22.945
This guy you're treating like a prize?

14:23.025 --> 14:24.105
I dumped him a long time ago.

14:24.185 --> 14:25.465
And him?

14:25.545 --> 14:28.105
He chased me around in fancy cars,
and I still wasn't interested.

14:28.185 --> 14:31.065
A divorced guy making less than me,
destined to be laid off by 40,

14:31.145 --> 14:33.545
doing nothing but playing
video games all day?

14:34.065 --> 14:35.145
You're welcome to him.

14:41.505 --> 14:42.625
She doesn't really get it.

14:43.985 --> 14:44.905
This car's actually nothing special.

14:44.985 --> 14:46.705
I've got a few more at home.

14:54.785 --> 14:55.945
Lin Long.

14:57.265 --> 14:59.425
-Stop following me.
-I know.

14:59.945 --> 15:03.745
I just wanted to say
you were really badass back there.

15:04.385 --> 15:05.745
Badass. Not "bad".

15:05.825 --> 15:06.825
I'm not insulting you.

15:07.345 --> 15:08.585
That day outside the bathroom,

15:08.665 --> 15:10.545
you went off on me just like that too.

15:10.625 --> 15:11.985
And I just thought…

15:15.545 --> 15:17.545
Do you just like getting kicked around?

15:18.625 --> 15:19.745
Maybe I do.

15:20.825 --> 15:22.985
Shen Jin. Open your eyes and look at me.

15:23.065 --> 15:26.145
I'm just a divorced woman
trying to prove she's still got it.

15:26.225 --> 15:28.105
Shallow, vain, and a total coward.

15:28.625 --> 15:31.785
I do want to thank you
for keeping me company when I was lonely.

15:31.865 --> 15:33.305
And sorry about just now.

15:33.385 --> 15:34.705
I had to use you to put on a front,

15:34.785 --> 15:36.945
so I could keep
what little dignity I have left

15:37.025 --> 15:38.185
in front of my ex-husband.

15:39.505 --> 15:41.305
And didn't you say
you felt nothing for me?

15:41.385 --> 15:43.265
So why are you clinging to me like this?

15:43.785 --> 15:44.865
Just because you can't stand losing?

15:46.145 --> 15:50.185
Or is it because a guy with your money
has never been dumped like this before?

15:50.265 --> 15:52.145
So, should I pay you
for emotional damages then?

15:56.505 --> 15:57.345
Lin Long,

15:58.265 --> 16:00.465
am I really that terrible?

16:00.545 --> 16:02.985
So terrible that you have to run away
every time you see me?

16:03.905 --> 16:05.705
And are you really that insecure?

16:05.785 --> 16:09.145
All you did was get a divorce
and hook up with a guy.

16:09.225 --> 16:12.865
How does that turn into being
a coward, insecure, and shallow?

16:13.985 --> 16:15.265
If you were really like that,

16:15.345 --> 16:17.585
I wouldn't have been chasing you this long
with zero shame.

16:19.225 --> 16:20.065
I know.

16:20.665 --> 16:22.225
You've been avoiding me

16:22.745 --> 16:27.665
because I chickened out
when you asked if I had feelings for you.

16:28.185 --> 16:30.225
Back then, I told you
it was just sympathy.

16:31.385 --> 16:34.985
But love isn't some high-stakes exam.

16:35.505 --> 16:37.265
Can't I change my answer
if I got it wrong?

16:38.305 --> 16:41.345
I admit I didn't mean
what I said that day.

16:41.945 --> 16:44.705
Later, I figured it out.
I really regret it.

16:46.185 --> 16:49.425
I'm not some young girl
who falls for fairy tales anymore.

16:50.065 --> 16:53.505
What you feel for me now
is just admiration and curiosity.

16:53.585 --> 16:55.745
Maybe mixed with a little
wounded pride and the need to win.

16:55.825 --> 16:57.065
If I said yes,

16:57.145 --> 16:58.705
you'd get bored of me
in less than a month.

16:59.545 --> 17:00.625
And me?

17:00.705 --> 17:02.825
I'd be really disappointed and hurt.

17:02.905 --> 17:06.265
Maybe I'd fall back
into that crazy mess I used to be.

17:06.345 --> 17:08.025
Like how I was when you first met me.

17:08.905 --> 17:10.905
Remember when I rear-ended your car?

17:10.985 --> 17:13.464
There wasn't an ounce
of admiration in your eyes.

17:15.625 --> 17:17.865
So if you think I'm badass now,

17:17.944 --> 17:20.865
please just let me hold
onto this fragile pride of mine. Okay?

17:22.025 --> 17:23.305
Because after the divorce,

17:24.825 --> 17:26.105
I don't have much pride left.

17:38.065 --> 17:38.945
Thank you.

18:04.385 --> 18:05.225
What are you doing here?

18:15.065 --> 18:16.625
Aren't you supposed
to be heading to the airport?

18:17.705 --> 18:19.745
Driving my girlfriend to work
is more important than a business trip.

18:19.825 --> 18:20.705
Get in.

18:26.705 --> 18:30.065
Actually, I just woke up to a notification
that my flight got delayed.

18:30.145 --> 18:33.265
Plus, I have some great news for you,

18:33.345 --> 18:34.185
so I came over.

18:34.265 --> 18:36.745
What great news?

18:36.825 --> 18:38.225
Give me your bank account number.

18:38.825 --> 18:39.865
Morse's bonus came through.

18:39.945 --> 18:40.985
One million.

18:41.505 --> 18:42.945
If it's not enough for a down payment,

18:43.545 --> 18:44.665
I can chip in.

18:45.985 --> 18:46.865
It's enough.

18:47.385 --> 18:49.305
With what I've saved,
it's definitely enough.

18:49.385 --> 18:50.865
And apartment prices
have been dropping lately.

18:50.945 --> 18:51.785
This is more than enough!

18:54.865 --> 18:57.585
This is… This is such great news.

18:58.785 --> 19:01.225
Xinzhi, thank you so much.

19:01.745 --> 19:04.905
Don't just say it. Show me.

19:06.545 --> 19:07.585
You're still driving.

19:22.865 --> 19:24.425
Message me when you land.

19:24.505 --> 19:26.105
-Bye.
-Bye.

19:33.385 --> 19:34.345
Morning.

19:36.545 --> 19:38.065
Morning. You're here for work too.

19:40.385 --> 19:42.345
Is that him? Your new boyfriend?

19:46.825 --> 19:47.905
Nice car.

19:48.905 --> 19:49.745
No wonder you broke up with me.

19:49.825 --> 19:52.145
We broke up because we weren't compatible,

19:52.225 --> 19:53.625
not because he drives a fancy car.

19:56.545 --> 19:57.665
I'm sorry.

20:00.305 --> 20:01.225
And I owe you a thank-you.

20:01.305 --> 20:02.745
If it weren't for you,

20:03.945 --> 20:05.145
I wouldn't have kept this job.

20:06.385 --> 20:07.225
It's fine.

20:09.585 --> 20:10.425
Can we still be friends?

20:14.185 --> 20:17.425
I've already repaid the favor
from when you helped me

20:18.065 --> 20:18.905
during the team-building.

20:19.625 --> 20:20.545
Let's just be colleagues from now on.

20:39.905 --> 20:41.425
What are you doing here?

20:41.505 --> 20:42.905
They had me swap project teams
with Yang Rui.

20:44.105 --> 20:44.985
Then go sit over there.

20:47.305 --> 20:48.425
Why are you still keeping your distance?

20:48.505 --> 20:50.305
Everyone who needs to know
already knows anyway.

21:07.865 --> 21:10.745
The Celestial project is back on track.

21:10.825 --> 21:14.385
Today's meeting is mainly
about restructuring the project team.

21:15.185 --> 21:17.105
Zhou Sen, Tianna, Du Qian.

21:17.185 --> 21:19.505
You'll still be in charge
of your original teams.

21:20.025 --> 21:20.905
Okay.

21:21.465 --> 21:24.745
Xu Chi, IT was at the heart
of the last mess,

21:24.825 --> 21:27.025
but I want you
to take the lead on it this time.

21:27.745 --> 21:29.625
Li Yue has experience in this area.

21:29.705 --> 21:31.825
-He'll back you up.
-Okay.

21:33.265 --> 21:35.065
As for the new project manager,

21:35.145 --> 21:36.825
the higher-ups haven't decided yet.

21:36.905 --> 21:39.225
I mean, we're already
more than halfway through this project.

21:39.305 --> 21:42.505
Bringing in a new consultant now
wouldn't be ideal.

21:42.585 --> 21:43.745
So Mr. Pi wants to pick

21:43.825 --> 21:47.225
one of the team leads
to fill in as acting manager.

21:47.305 --> 21:48.945
I'd like to hear what everyone thinks.

21:50.625 --> 21:51.465
Who do you think it'll be?

21:51.545 --> 21:53.945
You think I've got a shot?

21:54.865 --> 21:56.425
But we're just analysts.

21:56.505 --> 21:59.185
So what? Can't we aim higher?

22:00.225 --> 22:01.465
I'd like to nominate Tianna.

22:01.545 --> 22:02.665
Ever since Ma Ke's suspension,

22:02.745 --> 22:05.745
she's been coordinating
and running the entire project.

22:05.825 --> 22:06.865
Seconded.

22:08.985 --> 22:10.265
Wow.

22:11.345 --> 22:14.545
Now I finally get what it means
to be the obvious choice.

22:16.905 --> 22:18.585
Okay. Then let's congratulate Tianna

22:19.185 --> 22:21.625
on becoming Maxmise's
youngest project manager.

22:23.625 --> 22:24.985
Thank you, everyone.

22:30.945 --> 22:32.825
You all know I hate talking fluff,

22:32.905 --> 22:34.505
though that sentence itself was fluff.

22:34.585 --> 22:37.865
So now let me walk you through
my plan and progress

22:37.945 --> 22:39.625
since the project kicked off.

22:52.225 --> 22:53.265
Jealous?

22:57.225 --> 22:58.425
I'm just…

23:00.145 --> 23:01.665
I just

23:02.465 --> 23:03.585
wasn't ready for this.

23:04.905 --> 23:08.465
Honestly, when we both got promoted
to SBA around the same time,

23:08.545 --> 23:09.705
I was fine with it.

23:09.785 --> 23:14.505
But then she just shot past me
and became a project manager.

23:14.585 --> 23:17.545
-I just feel a little…
-I get it.

23:17.625 --> 23:21.665
Back when you took
the Bolo Culture project from me,

23:21.745 --> 23:22.585
I felt the same way.

23:22.665 --> 23:25.825
-Lin…
-I'm just kidding.

23:26.505 --> 23:29.785
Actually, this kind of thing happens
all the time at the company.

23:29.865 --> 23:31.385
Just like Lu Le and me.

23:31.465 --> 23:34.985
We're friends, but we're also rivals.

23:35.065 --> 23:36.105
So don't worry about it.

23:36.185 --> 23:37.825
After a few more times,
you'll get used to it.

23:38.705 --> 23:39.745
I know.

23:39.825 --> 23:41.865
It's not that I'm scared
to compete with her.

23:41.945 --> 23:43.905
When we were doing
the draft for Celestial,

23:43.985 --> 23:45.305
we went head-to-head.

23:46.065 --> 23:46.985
I just…

23:48.665 --> 23:51.465
And Tianna didn't tell me anything.

23:51.545 --> 23:53.385
I didn't even know she took over
the whole Celestial project

23:53.465 --> 23:55.105
while I was suspended.

23:57.665 --> 24:00.825
When you were suspended,
you went to help Morse pull off a deal.

24:00.905 --> 24:01.985
You didn't tell Tianna
about that beforehand, did you?

24:04.065 --> 24:06.505
There's no such thing
as absolute fairness in the workplace.

24:06.585 --> 24:08.705
While you're grinding,
other people aren't just sitting around.

24:09.705 --> 24:12.065
Back when Celestial and Maxmise
were at each other's throats,

24:12.145 --> 24:14.505
everyone thought the project was done for.

24:14.585 --> 24:15.945
But Tianna was the only one
who didn't give up.

24:16.025 --> 24:18.945
She went to Mr. Pi and fought
to keep the project from being shut down.

24:19.025 --> 24:22.545
She coordinated with colleagues
to go through the investigation,

24:22.625 --> 24:23.985
while keeping the project moving.

24:24.865 --> 24:27.905
So without her drive and effort,

24:27.985 --> 24:31.025
do you really think Celestial would've
decided to restart the whole project

24:31.105 --> 24:33.065
the second they saw
your evidence clearing Ma Ke?

24:41.025 --> 24:41.945
I get it.

24:42.985 --> 24:47.865
I really have no right
to be jealous of her.

24:50.505 --> 24:51.385
Thanks for setting me straight.

24:53.105 --> 24:54.985
Call it payback.

24:55.065 --> 24:58.265
After all, I was a pretty lousy mentor.

24:58.345 --> 24:59.825
I never really gave you any real guidance.

25:02.665 --> 25:05.825
But now I think you're actually grounded.

25:05.905 --> 25:09.225
Like a girl who hasn't been
out of school for long.

25:09.305 --> 25:13.905
Not like one of those prodigy girls
you only see in books or TV shows.

25:19.065 --> 25:20.185
Is this more like it?

25:23.905 --> 25:25.025
Let me check a message.

25:33.625 --> 25:35.585
That's the amulet
Mr. Shen gave you, right?

25:35.665 --> 25:36.705
You're still wearing it.

25:39.665 --> 25:40.505
No idea if it even works.

25:40.585 --> 25:42.385
I use it as a phone charm.

25:42.465 --> 25:43.305
Just got used to it.

26:44.585 --> 26:46.305
I zoned out.

26:46.825 --> 26:48.585
I just suddenly thought

26:48.665 --> 26:50.625
of something I discussed
in a call with Celestial.

26:54.025 --> 26:54.905
Don't push yourself so hard.

26:56.105 --> 26:57.705
I've already been
on two business trips this week.

26:57.785 --> 27:00.385
We only get two hours together today,

27:00.465 --> 27:01.545
and you're still working so hard.

27:01.625 --> 27:02.905
You're practically getting dark circles.

27:04.825 --> 27:05.905
Do I have them?

27:06.425 --> 27:07.505
Where?

27:07.585 --> 27:09.305
Just kidding.

27:11.265 --> 27:13.105
Back when you were my protege,

27:13.185 --> 27:15.305
I could only tell you to take it easy
when I saw you grinding like this.

27:16.105 --> 27:17.985
But now, as your boyfriend,

27:18.065 --> 27:20.665
I have to seriously tell you
to stop pushing so hard.

27:21.185 --> 27:23.425
Don't treat yourself like a work machine.

27:24.105 --> 27:26.585
Consulting is a marathon of output.

27:26.665 --> 27:28.225
If you keep pulling
all-nighters like this,

27:28.305 --> 27:30.305
you'll burn yourself out sooner or later.

27:45.225 --> 27:47.385
What's wrong? Tired of me nagging?

27:49.745 --> 27:52.745
I just want your work to be easier.

27:54.265 --> 27:57.705
But we both prefer seeing
each other strive to do better, right?

28:00.465 --> 28:01.305
Okay, okay.

28:01.825 --> 28:03.865
Whatever the lady says goes.

28:06.065 --> 28:07.185
I think so too.

28:08.625 --> 28:09.465
-Eat up.
-Eat up.

28:22.865 --> 28:23.945
Honestly,

28:24.945 --> 28:26.385
I just want to push a little harder.

28:26.465 --> 28:28.265
I don't want to be outdone by Tianna.

28:31.025 --> 28:31.865
I get it.

28:32.585 --> 28:34.265
But don't forget

28:34.345 --> 28:36.105
why you got into this industry
in the first place.

28:37.305 --> 28:39.945
Don't let specific issues
get you completely bogged down.

28:40.745 --> 28:42.305
Of course I haven't forgotten.

28:42.385 --> 28:45.185
I want to be a top consultant like you,

28:45.265 --> 28:46.185
make partner,

28:46.265 --> 28:48.785
have my own office,
and buy back my mom's old apartment.

28:50.585 --> 28:51.425
Apartment.

28:53.305 --> 28:55.585
I told the agent this morning
that I had the money ready.

28:56.105 --> 28:58.225
I've been so busy all day
that I forgot to ask him for an update.

28:58.305 --> 28:59.665
Where's my phone?

29:00.625 --> 29:01.465
Right here.

29:02.185 --> 29:03.265
Any updates?

29:04.345 --> 29:05.745
The agent said apartment prices
dropped again.

29:05.825 --> 29:08.025
The guy who signed online before
changed his mind and backed out.

29:08.785 --> 29:10.505
Then the landlord said

29:10.585 --> 29:13.185
if I could pay the same price,
he'd sell it to me.

29:13.265 --> 29:14.265
That's great news.

29:15.745 --> 29:17.105
Hey, Zhu. This is Xu Chi.

29:17.185 --> 29:19.185
How did it go?
When did the landlord say we could sign?

29:22.825 --> 29:24.545
What? How could he just
change his mind like that?

29:24.625 --> 29:25.625
What happened?

29:26.825 --> 29:27.665
The landlord backed out.

29:27.745 --> 29:29.705
He said I need to pay in full
to close the deal.

29:31.585 --> 29:32.465
Don't panic just yet.

29:32.545 --> 29:34.465
Let's head over right now
and talk to him in person.

29:36.505 --> 29:39.265
Xu, we go way back.
How could I pull anything on you?

29:39.345 --> 29:40.825
The landlord already agreed.

29:40.905 --> 29:42.505
He even went to the transaction center.

29:42.585 --> 29:44.985
But the paperwork to cancel the signing
and get the tax refund is a hassle.

29:45.065 --> 29:46.865
He got annoyed
and didn't want to deal with it.

29:47.585 --> 29:49.985
He said if he sold it to you,
he'd have to make trips again,

29:50.065 --> 29:52.905
and waiting for your loan approval
would take months.

29:52.985 --> 29:56.865
So either you pay in full
or he's not canceling the signing.

29:56.945 --> 29:58.225
Come on.

29:58.305 --> 30:00.225
Banks approve mortgages really fast now.

30:00.305 --> 30:01.945
And I know people there.
I definitely won't drag it out.

30:02.865 --> 30:03.905
How about this?

30:05.305 --> 30:07.585
Can you help me contact him
so I can talk to him in person?

30:07.665 --> 30:09.785
But it's 11 p.m. now.

30:09.865 --> 30:11.025
He's probably asleep.

30:11.105 --> 30:14.425
Besides, the notes say
he's only available during the day.

30:15.225 --> 30:16.825
-Then… Then I…
-Easy now.

30:18.945 --> 30:20.745
The landlord really said
it has to be full payment, right?

30:20.825 --> 30:22.745
Yes… It's true. Why would I lie to you?

30:22.825 --> 30:26.305
Whether you pay in full or take a loan,
our commission is the same.

30:26.385 --> 30:28.545
The landlord wouldn't
let us see the place.

30:28.625 --> 30:30.305
Now he's about to sell it.

30:30.385 --> 30:31.425
Can you take us to see it?

30:33.065 --> 30:33.905
Alright.

30:44.945 --> 30:47.225
I'll step out and take a call.

30:55.425 --> 30:57.865
Remember which room
you stayed in as a kid?

31:00.425 --> 31:01.905
It should be this one.

31:09.185 --> 31:10.465
No, I think it was this one.

31:11.985 --> 31:13.025
You don't remember?

31:19.425 --> 31:21.505
This used to be my grandma's apartment.

31:22.305 --> 31:25.225
I only got to come and stay here
with my mom during the holidays.

31:26.945 --> 31:28.145
It's been so many years.

31:29.025 --> 31:31.465
This place looks nothing like I remember.

31:37.585 --> 31:38.545
All I remember

31:39.785 --> 31:43.505
is that my mom sold it for 80,000 yuan
to help my dad fund his business.

31:45.145 --> 31:47.905
Then my dad got a mistress.

31:48.425 --> 31:49.905
My mom divorced him.

31:51.185 --> 31:54.025
When my mom saw on the news that
apartment prices here had skyrocketed,

31:54.105 --> 31:55.385
she regretted it so much.

31:57.825 --> 32:00.385
Before my mom passed,
she told me so many times.

32:01.825 --> 32:04.385
She said she really wanted to go back
to before she met my dad.

32:06.305 --> 32:07.705
Back to Beijing.

32:09.745 --> 32:10.905
Back to this apartment.

32:16.385 --> 32:17.945
But I was too young then.

32:19.025 --> 32:20.385
There was nothing I could do.

32:20.985 --> 32:24.585
Is this her wish or yours?

32:26.745 --> 32:27.945
Is there a difference?

32:30.905 --> 32:33.865
Anyway, every time I'm sad, I come here.

32:33.945 --> 32:38.345
Just looking at this little building
and that window full of flowers,

32:38.865 --> 32:40.305
it's like I go back in time.

32:40.945 --> 32:44.705
Back to when I was happiest.

32:54.065 --> 32:55.465
Then let's buy this place.

32:58.065 --> 32:59.465
I don't have that kind of money.

32:59.545 --> 33:00.825
You've got me.

33:04.345 --> 33:05.985
That's not what I meant.

33:06.065 --> 33:07.025
Sometimes,

33:07.665 --> 33:09.545
opportunity matters more than money.

33:09.625 --> 33:12.585
-But I can't just use your money.
-You already missed out once.

33:13.185 --> 33:14.505
You can't miss it again.

33:14.585 --> 33:16.625
If it really bothers you,

33:17.345 --> 33:18.825
we can sign a loan agreement.

33:19.825 --> 33:24.945
Chi, give me a chance
to do what a boyfriend should do.

33:26.145 --> 33:26.985
Alright?

34:11.985 --> 34:12.905
Hey, ladies.

34:12.985 --> 34:14.744
Long time no see.

34:14.824 --> 34:15.744
Missed you guys so much.

34:22.545 --> 34:23.465
Let me give you a quick update.

34:23.545 --> 34:25.905
Today I'm doing the preliminary delivery
with the Reinsurance Department.

34:27.225 --> 34:28.225
Let's talk about it
at the morning meeting.

34:28.304 --> 34:30.865
-Okay.
-Uh, I can't make the morning meeting.

34:30.945 --> 34:32.665
And I need to take some time off.

34:32.744 --> 34:35.865
At 8:40, I'm meeting Mr. Sun
to check the database.

34:35.945 --> 34:37.505
And tomorrow, I'm going
on a business trip with him.

34:38.185 --> 34:40.225
We're hitting Celestial's data centers

34:40.304 --> 34:42.344
in Guangzhou, Shenzhen,
Chengdu, and Suzhou

34:42.425 --> 34:44.505
to do on-site training delivery.

34:44.585 --> 34:46.105
Probably won't be back until the weekend.

34:46.185 --> 34:47.705
That many places in such a short time?

34:47.784 --> 34:48.784
Can your body handle it?

34:49.385 --> 34:51.545
Okay, as long
as you've got it planned out.

34:51.625 --> 34:52.784
No need to send daily reports.

34:52.865 --> 34:54.025
Just give me a summary when you're back.

34:56.385 --> 34:57.225
IT Department's on the 17th floor.

34:57.305 --> 34:58.665
I'll take the high-zone elevator.

34:58.745 --> 34:59.945
Bye.

35:03.425 --> 35:05.185
My bad. My bad.

35:08.305 --> 35:12.065
She's grinding right now,
trying to pull ahead of me.

35:12.145 --> 35:13.185
Don't hold her back.

35:13.745 --> 35:14.705
No way.

35:14.785 --> 35:16.665
You've already been project manager
for some time.

35:16.745 --> 35:18.385
Even if she knocks it out of the park
with the IT Department,

35:18.465 --> 35:19.305
she still can't top you.

35:19.385 --> 35:21.785
Do you really think this hand-me-down
project manager spot

35:21.865 --> 35:22.745
is worth all that much?

35:22.825 --> 35:25.105
She and I are both gunning for a partner.

35:25.185 --> 35:27.385
You think we care
about some temporary title? No.

35:27.465 --> 35:29.625
What we care about is Mr. Pi and Sha Sha's

35:29.705 --> 35:32.545
overall evaluation
after this project wraps.

35:32.625 --> 35:34.985
That affects how far I can go at Maxmise.

35:35.585 --> 35:37.025
-Get it?
-Got it.

35:39.265 --> 35:41.185
Okay, I'm done talking to you.

35:41.785 --> 35:42.625
Have to go grind too.

35:45.545 --> 35:46.385
How about this?

35:46.465 --> 35:49.385
Let me grind with you at your place
these next few days?

35:52.545 --> 35:53.505
You wish.

36:02.785 --> 36:04.345
MOM

36:06.705 --> 36:08.425
I'll take the stairs.

36:12.665 --> 36:13.745
Hey, Mom.

36:14.665 --> 36:16.105
What's up? I'm at work.

36:18.705 --> 36:19.705
A blind date?

36:21.145 --> 36:22.065
I'm not going.

36:22.145 --> 36:23.105
You guys promised me

36:23.185 --> 36:25.905
you'd never pull this blind date
nonsense on me. I…

36:27.665 --> 36:28.505
Dad.

36:30.505 --> 36:32.985
Okay, I got it.

36:33.065 --> 36:34.065
I'll be there on time.

36:48.305 --> 36:49.505
BETTER HOME TOGETHER

37:05.185 --> 37:06.145
Tianna.

37:06.665 --> 37:09.265
Ms. Xue's son works in IT.

37:09.345 --> 37:12.145
I heard he's doing really well.

37:13.305 --> 37:14.785
Wow, that's impressive.

37:15.305 --> 37:17.745
So if my laptop breaks,
can he fix it for me?

37:17.825 --> 37:18.705
Don't be silly.

37:18.785 --> 37:20.825
His company is huge.

37:21.345 --> 37:23.585
Come on. Don't pull that long face.

37:23.665 --> 37:27.465
Your dad wanted you to come
and vet the guy for him.

37:27.545 --> 37:29.345
He recently got into some…

37:30.025 --> 37:31.065
What's it called again?

37:31.145 --> 37:32.825
It's a new business model, anyway.

37:33.465 --> 37:34.465
Perfect timing.

37:34.545 --> 37:37.025
Ms. Xue's son works in tech.

37:37.105 --> 37:38.945
Don't overthink it.

37:39.025 --> 37:40.385
It's not a blind date.

37:40.465 --> 37:42.345
Just think of it as making a new friend.

37:43.305 --> 37:44.265
Have a nice chat.

37:45.625 --> 37:46.865
Right this way. It's this private room.

37:46.945 --> 37:48.185
Thank you. Hui!

37:49.385 --> 37:51.185
-Come on.
-You're already here.

37:51.785 --> 37:54.105
-Mrs. Xue is here.
-So sorry. We're late.

37:54.185 --> 37:55.905
-Son, come on.
-Quick.

37:55.985 --> 37:57.585
-Long time no see.
-Exactly.

37:57.665 --> 37:59.185
-And this is…?
-Tianna.

37:59.265 --> 38:00.505
Say hi.

38:00.585 --> 38:02.545
-Hi, Ms. Xue.
-Hello.

38:02.625 --> 38:03.705
So pretty.

38:04.225 --> 38:08.025
Jin, Tianna also studied in the US.

38:08.105 --> 38:11.025
-She's a consultant now.
-Okay, Mom.

38:12.145 --> 38:13.345
I know Mr. Shen.

38:13.945 --> 38:16.105
-He's a client of our company.
-Know each other?

38:16.625 --> 38:20.945
-They've known each other.
-So I'll go chat with him outside?

38:21.625 --> 38:22.865
-Sure.
-Great.

38:22.945 --> 38:24.065
Go chat with her.

38:25.105 --> 38:26.065
Go on.

38:29.945 --> 38:32.505
The other day, you were chasing Lin down
in the parking lot,

38:32.585 --> 38:34.385
and now you're out on a blind date.

38:34.465 --> 38:36.625
Mr. Shen, your time management
is really something.

38:38.425 --> 38:39.905
Fellow sufferers of the same fate.

38:39.985 --> 38:41.225
Cut each other some slack.

38:41.305 --> 38:43.065
Aren't you out on a blind date
behind your boyfriend's back?

38:45.465 --> 38:47.665
Don't talk nonsense.
I don't have a boyfriend.

38:49.225 --> 38:51.225
Okay, whatever you say.

38:52.905 --> 38:54.345
You're really…

38:55.065 --> 38:56.625
Why are you being so snarky?

38:57.825 --> 38:58.825
No wonder Lin doesn't like you.

39:04.065 --> 39:04.945
What, did I say something wrong?

39:07.785 --> 39:08.865
No. You're right.

39:10.065 --> 39:10.945
She really doesn't like me.

39:12.705 --> 39:14.425
By the way, how's she been?

39:16.185 --> 39:17.025
You wanna know?

39:18.705 --> 39:22.105
You think I'd be nice enough to tell you?

39:28.185 --> 39:29.305
Let's make a deal.

39:29.385 --> 39:31.625
Tell me how she's been,

39:32.145 --> 39:36.185
and I guarantee your mom won't bug you
for a long time.

39:39.185 --> 39:40.185
Really?

39:41.305 --> 39:43.065
-At least half a year?
-A whole year, even.

39:46.825 --> 39:48.505
What do you think they're talking about?

39:48.585 --> 39:50.425
They're really hitting it off.

39:51.465 --> 39:52.385
Now tell me.

39:52.905 --> 39:54.105
How's she been?

39:55.665 --> 39:57.105
She's fine. Everything's normal.

39:58.145 --> 39:59.825
-That's it?
-Yeah.

39:59.905 --> 40:00.985
That's worth a year?

40:01.065 --> 40:03.185
What else do you want?

40:03.265 --> 40:06.945
Lin got divorced
and ended up in the hospital.

40:07.025 --> 40:10.145
After all that, she comes back to work
as if nothing happened.

40:10.225 --> 40:12.865
You expect her to be heartbroken?

40:12.945 --> 40:14.265
Besides,

40:14.345 --> 40:17.945
you're the one pursuing her like crazy,
not the other way around.

40:18.025 --> 40:19.105
Are you done?

40:19.625 --> 40:22.545
If you keep throwing out
these useless comments,

40:22.625 --> 40:23.545
I'm calling off the deal.

40:24.145 --> 40:25.465
No, then what…

40:26.305 --> 40:27.705
Then what else do you want to know?

40:28.705 --> 40:29.905
I want to know…

40:38.305 --> 40:39.825
I don't even know what I want to know.

40:43.105 --> 40:46.625
I don't even know what she really wants.

40:49.265 --> 40:50.945
I told her to stop selling herself short,

40:51.865 --> 40:53.785
but she still told me to stay away.

40:53.865 --> 40:55.745
She said

40:55.825 --> 40:58.025
she wants to keep
her dignity and her pride.

41:01.305 --> 41:02.145
What are you laughing at?

41:03.865 --> 41:04.785
Sorry.

41:05.465 --> 41:07.345
I'm just laughing at how dumb you are.

41:08.105 --> 41:09.265
What do you mean?

41:10.545 --> 41:13.665
What did she say she wanted to keep?

41:13.745 --> 41:14.945
Her dignity and pride.

41:15.025 --> 41:17.625
Then it must be because you did something

41:17.705 --> 41:19.225
that made her feel
like she lost her dignity.

41:19.305 --> 41:21.345
That's like dragging someone
who's scared of heights

41:21.425 --> 41:23.105
up to a rooftop and telling her,

41:23.185 --> 41:25.185
"Honey, don't be scared." Does that help?

41:29.745 --> 41:30.585
So that's it.

41:32.345 --> 41:34.185
Okay. Now you know. Go explain yourself.

41:36.505 --> 41:37.465
No rush.

41:38.625 --> 41:39.825
Never go into battle unprepared.

41:41.145 --> 41:42.385
Let me tell you something.

41:42.465 --> 41:45.945
Missy, don't think you can boss me around
on everything.

41:46.545 --> 41:48.345
If you were actually good
at this love stuff,

41:48.425 --> 41:50.065
you wouldn't be here tonight.

41:53.945 --> 41:55.185
I wasted my breath on you.

41:59.145 --> 42:00.345
It wasn't wasted.

42:01.425 --> 42:02.265
Come closer.

42:04.505 --> 42:05.585
I said come closer.

42:06.305 --> 42:07.785
Why should I come closer?

42:09.825 --> 42:11.025
The choice is yours.

42:19.865 --> 42:20.905
Is it okay now?

42:22.385 --> 42:24.625
-Take my arm.
-Take your arm?

42:37.625 --> 42:38.625
On my cue.

42:39.145 --> 42:42.385
I'll count to three,
and we turn around, look back,

42:42.465 --> 42:44.505
smile, and nod.

42:44.585 --> 42:45.425
Got it?

42:46.625 --> 42:48.345
I asked if you got it.

42:48.425 --> 42:49.265
Answer me properly.

42:51.625 --> 42:54.385
-Got it, Mr. Shen.
-Three, two, one.

43:00.625 --> 43:02.305
You two go ahead and chat.

43:02.385 --> 43:03.745
You two have a nice talk.

43:06.865 --> 43:11.225
But holding arms on a first blind date
is a bit much, isn't it?

43:11.305 --> 43:14.225
There's worse. Wanna try?

43:14.785 --> 43:16.505
-No thanks.
-So it wasn't wasted, was it?

43:17.665 --> 43:18.785
No, Mr. Shen.
